            "review_title": "Review at Vị Noodles - Ramen & Matcha Latte",
            "review_text": "Celina\nOsaka, Japan16 contributions\n0\nA authentic Japanese you should visit in town!\nFeb 2026 • Friends\nDelicious food! Each part was very well made and the soup is salty and creamy and yummy! The staff are also very friendly, they took us through the popular parts of the menu and made recommendations. Very calm and chill music too, overall a great experience!\nWritten March 6, 2026",
