            "review_title": "Review at Vị Noodles - Ramen & Matcha Latte",
            "review_text": "Michica\nKyoto Prefecture, Japan5 contributions\n0\nA ramen shop tucked away in a back alley. There are exquisite ramen here that you can't taste anywhere else.\nMar 2025 • Friends\nI never thought such a good ramen restaurant would be in such a quiet place in the 7th Ward.\nHonestly, it tastes as good as any famous restaurant in the 1st arrondissement, and maybe even better.\nPlease try “cotton ramen” and “tsukemen”. The matcha latte is also really good.\n\nI think this store should be better known. Even though the price is much more reasonable than other shops,\nThe quality is overwhelming. The staff are attentive and friendly, and you'll be happy with the food.\nRead more\nTranslated from Japanese\nShow original\nWritten June 7, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
